#: environments/airship_1931.env.json
msgid "A 1931 rigid airship's promenade lounge: leaning-out observation windows in duralumin girders, a self-playing featherweight grand piano, and an endless moonlit sea of clouds far below."
msgstr ""

#: environments/atmospheric_1928.env.json
msgid "A picture palace built as a Mediterranean courtyard at dusk: lit windows, iron balconies, a palace gate with an organ, a crescent moon and real stars."
msgstr ""

#: environments/back_seat_2004.env.json
msgid "The rain-streaked back seat of a 2004 family car cruising a night motorway: a flip-down roof screen, glowing dashboard dials, tartan blanket, drifting raindrops and lit services at arrival."
msgstr ""

#: environments/bathysphere.env.json
msgid "A glass dome on the sea floor: kelp and coral in the floodlights, schools of fish, glowing creatures drawn to the screen, a manta overhead, and in a quiet scene now and then a whale."
msgstr ""

#: environments/cenote_cavern.env.json
msgid "An underground limestone sinkhole and crystal grotto cinema: turquoise cenote water, glowing mineral crystals, warm cave lanterns, and a jungle oculus open to the tropical night sky."
msgstr ""

#: environments/cinema.env.json
msgid "The converted cinema: rows on a rake, curtains that part when the film starts, and the house lights going down."
msgstr ""

#: environments/cinema_coach_1935.env.json
msgid "A 1935 express railway cinema carriage rolling through autumn night: mahogany panelling, swaying brass lamps, telegraph poles, a dark railway tunnel mid-reel and a warm terminus with the credits."
msgstr ""

#: environments/cloud_temple.env.json
msgid "An open-air white-marble sanctuary suspended above an endless golden-dusk sea of clouds: sixteen fluted columns, a sky-reflecting water basin, four bronze braziers, and rising stars."
msgstr ""

#: environments/coach_trip_1988.env.json
msgid "An overnight touring coach in 1988: swirly moquette, overhead 4:3 CRT and flashing video deck, drawn cab curtain, sodium-lit motorway night and glowing intermission services."
msgstr ""

#: environments/crater.env.json
msgid "A Moon base's cinema under a geodesic glass dome: Earth turns slowly over the screen, the crater's peaks catch the sun, and the Milky Way comes out when the lights go down."
msgstr ""

#: environments/dome_car_1955.env.json
msgid "An upper-deck stainless-steel observation dome car crossing moonlit Southwest canyon country: desert twilight deepens to the full Milky Way and shooting stars arching across the curved glass roof."
msgstr ""

#: environments/drive_in_1958.env.json
msgid "A drive-in lot at dusk, seen from a convertible's bench seat: the stars come out over the film, moths in the beam, mesas on the horizon."
msgstr ""

#: environments/flagship.env.json
msgid "A big modern cinema: a steep rake, folded acoustic walls washed in amber, recliners, a starlit ceiling of baffles and a huge curved screen in velvet."
msgstr ""

#: environments/giants_study.env.json
msgid "Ten centimetres tall on a giant mahogany desk in a rainy late-night study: leather-bound books, steaming porcelain teacup, ticking brass pocket watch, banker's lamp, and a propped pocket display."
msgstr ""

#: environments/ice_cinema.env.json
msgid "An ice hotel's cinema of sawn blocks and carvings under an ice vault: candles glowing inside the ice, hides on ice benches, the polar night and the northern lights outside."
msgstr ""

#: environments/jet_1964.env.json
msgid "A 1964 first-class transpolar jet cabin: oval windows over a moonlit cloud sea, a ceiling 16 mm twin-reel projector onto a pull-down screen, air-tube audio, and polar aurora in quiet scenes."
msgstr ""

#: environments/liner_1936.env.json
msgid "An ocean liner's moderne lounge crossing at night: the ship never rolls while the tall velvet drapes sway gently, the Moon lays a road across open sea, and harbour lights rise with the credits."
msgstr ""

#: environments/mars_train.env.json
msgid "A pressurised Martian rover-train crossing a rust-ochre plain under a real blue Martian sunset: dust devils fade as starlight takes the sky, arriving at a glowing domed night colony."
msgstr ""

#: environments/moon_ferry.env.json
msgid "A retro-future cislunar passenger liner gliding silently through star-filled space: Earth shrinks astern while the cratered Moon grows ahead, ending in a gentle touchdown at the lunar Crater base."
msgstr ""

#: environments/narrowboat.env.json
msgid "A canal boat's saloon at walking pace: dusk falls as reeds, willows and a brick bridge slide past the windows, a village's lights come up, and the boat ties up at a lamp-lit wharf with the credits."
msgstr ""

#: environments/nave.env.json
msgid "A Gothic nave at night, the screen in the chancel: piers rising into rib vaults, candles on iron stands and coronae, coloured glass and a rose window in the moonlight."
msgstr ""

#: environments/night_ferry_1994.env.json
msgid "A cross-Channel ferry's video lounge in 1994: reclining seats under a bracketed CRT telly, salt-streaked storm windows, a sweeping lighthouse beam and a floodlit ferry port with the credits."
msgstr ""

#: environments/night_sleeper_1929.env.json
msgid "A 1929 Art Deco marquetry sleeping compartment crossing a snowy alpine night: flakes drift past the window under the Moon, a tabletop 16 mm projector hums, and rosy dawn rises with the credits."
msgstr ""

#: environments/orbital_ring.env.json
msgid "A cantilevered travertine and titanium observation terrace inside a rotating space habitat cylinder: upside-down valleys, silver rivers and night cities curve overhead between Milky Way windows."
msgstr ""

#: environments/palace_of_culture_1974.env.json
msgid "A palace of culture, 1974: board-marked concrete, two great mosaics that glitter in the screen's light, a field of glowing globes, and snow falling through the open roof."
msgstr ""

#: environments/pillow_fort_1993.env.json
msgid "A pillow fort in a bedroom, 1993: cushions and a bedsheet, fairy lights, rain on the window, and the telly filling the opening."
msgstr ""

#: environments/pink_palace.env.json
msgid "A dream palace in sugared almond colours: inside a great shell, its ribs glowing pink and blue round a sunburst dome, scalloped arches, mirrors, a buttoned balcony, a festoon with a gold fringe."
msgstr ""

#: environments/reclaimed.env.json
msgid "An old picture house taken back by nature: half its roof gone to the stars, ivy and ferns, rain into a puddle that gives back the film."
msgstr ""

#: environments/rooftop_athens.env.json
msgid "A summer cinema on an Athens roof: director's chairs on terracotta tiles, bougainvillea, strings of bulbs, the picture painted on a blind wall, a floodlit temple on its hill, the city all round."
msgstr ""

#: environments/salon_1870.env.json
msgid "A Victorian 1870 submarine salon in crimson velvet and mahogany: twin brass iris viewports spiral open to reveal swaying giant kelp, silver fish, a sunken wreck, and deep volcanic vents."
msgstr ""

#: environments/screen_3_1983.env.json
msgid "A tired multiplex screen, 1983: plasterboard, a swirly carpet, a broken seat, smoke in the beam and a worn print."
msgstr ""

#: environments/screening_room_1962.env.json
msgid "A collector's private cinema in the hills, 1962: walnut and brass, a slow fire on a floating hearth, the pool glowing outside the glass, the city's lights below, a painting that rises off the screen."
msgstr ""

#: environments/shopfront_1906.env.json
msgid "A shopfront picture house, 1906: a pressed tin ceiling, folding chairs, gas lamps and a dusty beam from the tin booth."
msgstr ""

#: environments/showboat_1927.env.json
msgid "A floating theatre drifting down a wide river: cottonwoods and a levee town slide past the tall windows at dusk, a steamer lies at anchor, and the show ties up at a lamp-lit landing with the credits."
msgstr ""

#: environments/sky_lift.env.json
msgid "An orbital elevator climber car ascending from an equatorial ocean tether platform through the cloud deck into black star-filled orbit, with Earth's glowing curved limb opening out beneath you."
msgstr ""

#: environments/streamline_1937.env.json
msgid "A streamline cinema, 1937: coves that glow and change colour, a stepped proscenium round a rising sun, faience bands round the hall, an organ that rises from the pit, a festoon."
msgstr ""

#: environments/sunken_rotunda.env.json
msgid "A flooded marble rotunda on the sunlit sea floor: mosaic dais, fluted colonnade under a ruined oculus, rippling canal, schooling fish, glowing jellies, a manta ray and a rare whale."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1930.env.json
msgid "The first television, 1930: a small glowing picture in a cabinet, the chair pulled up close."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1937.env.json
msgid "A drawing room in 1937: a tall cabinet whose lid holds a mirror, the picture seen in the mirror, a marble fireplace and a tea tray."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1953.env.json
msgid "Coronation day, June 1953: every chair in the house round one small set, bunting across the ceiling, sandwiches and tea, rain at the window."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1966.env.json
msgid "A living room in 1966: the rented set on splayed legs with its channel dial, a teak sideboard, an orange settee."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1972.env.json
msgid "The first colour set, 1972: the television in the corner and the chairs in a row."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1983.env.json
msgid "A portable on a desk, 1983: a small screen up close, as a home computer's was."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1987.env.json
msgid "A family set in 1987: a rented tape, the settee across from the television."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_1993.env.json
msgid "A bedroom telly in 1993, seen from a bean bag on the floor."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_2002.env.json
msgid "A lounge in 2002: a big deep rear projection set filling the end of the room, a leather sofa, a glass coffee table."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_2005.env.json
msgid "The first flat screen, 2005: a wide picture on a stand, the sofa further back."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_future.env.json
msgid "A calm bare room some day to come: no set at all, a part of the wall wakes and becomes the picture."
msgstr ""

#: environments/tv_today.env.json
msgid "A living room today: a thin panel on a dark wall, a soundbar under it, a floor lamp by the sofa. The film at its best."
msgstr ""

#: environments/venus_aerostat.env.json
msgid "A gilded hammered-copper and brass Art Nouveau cloud gondola suspended 52 km above Venus inside sunlit golden-amber cloud canyons beneath a glowing ivory buoyant gas envelope."
msgstr ""

#: environments/void.env.json
msgid "Nothing but black and a mirror floor that gives back the film, with a ripple where you move."
msgstr ""

